Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Trigun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.30,0:01:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.20,0:01:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.46,0:01:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:01:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.04,0:02:02.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy your rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been traveling around for so long,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.68,0:02:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I haven't quite\Nregained my land legs yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.12,0:02:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be strange to be home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, Miss Strife, you witnessed the\Nhole being burned into the fifth moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did it make you\Nfeel when you looked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not some tourist interview, Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.32,0:02:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking to someone who\Nspent five months on the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,working with the ultra-dangerous man\Nwho's been labeled a human disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.40,0:02:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering everything that's\Nhappened to her out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle she came back alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.42,0:02:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, it wasn't as bad as all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it got a little bit scary at times?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there was some danger involved?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite his frightening\Nand awful reputation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.70,0:02:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash turned out to be\Nmore of a regular guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than you would have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reality check, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attitude of yours gets all the oddball\Njobs, working with dangerous slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.78,0:02:51.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great that you're\Nso competent and willing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you keep risking\Nyour life out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's no way you'll\Never achieve womanly happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:03:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this social time, ladies and gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see you, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.24,0:03:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl, will you please\Nstep into my office?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.76,0:03:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Millie? Millie? Where\Nare you? I'm out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.58,0:03:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you gotten yourself into now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm being punished for coming\Nin late for work 20 times in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do I expect her to change?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.84,0:03:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.88,0:03:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.79,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got another assignment today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede showed up in Little\NJersey, and we're the only ones qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We leave right away. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that make you incredibly happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be happy about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our jobs are on the line here, Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to stop him this time\Nbefore he stirs up trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:52.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on a second, Meryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you being a little hasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, if he's alive,\Nhe could have at least mentioned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.54,0:04:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He probably gets a kick out of\Nmaking people bite his dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meryl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you back an\NAAP bag as a souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.50,0:04:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later, Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There she goes again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose there's just some girls\Nwho need to risk their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're dead, you don't\Nhave to say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.42,0:04:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you're alive, I would appreciate\Nif you fellas would say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, gee.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.32,0:04:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, bless you, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.68,0:04:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am pretty damn happy to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.34,0:04:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it that I always run into\Nso much trouble when you're around?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a very\Nmethodical person, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.34,0:04:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Normally when you buy a used bike,\Nyou're supposed to repair it, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make sure it's in decent condition before\Nyou decide to take it out and ride it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dissing my Angelina II?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm dissing you, not\Nyour stupid broken motorcycle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again, needle noggin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.86,0:05:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who you calling needle noggin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.82,0:05:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say it's pretty darn obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.96,0:05:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now look what you've done, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so now it's my fault, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up back there, or\NI'll have to fool you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is that me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir, we're really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now where are you guys headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.83,0:05:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, New Oregon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to the town with all the\Ndisappearances in Southern Cornelia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I want to go to New Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to go to Kansas,\Ngo there by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.40,0:05:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said, shut up, your turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is really falling apart
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.48,0:05:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go over where we're from making\Ntrouble as usual Then all of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.90,0:06:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a sudden this guy stepped in to\Nhelp Seemed like a pretty well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-meaning fella And unfortunately\Nthis is what happened as a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,result Once again he's poked his\Nnose into more trouble Honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that man never learns Meryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just found out where Vash\Nis and they said he's okay
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.47,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one and only humanoid\Ntyphoon He carries the dubious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,title of mankind's first\Nlocalized human disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:28.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was weeping and eating piles of\Ndonuts at the same time, just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donuts are his favorite food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.76,0:06:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This nutcase is actually\Nthe legendary gunman?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where'd you get your\Ninformation, Millie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.16,0:06:39.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The report said that he's headed for New\NOregon at a speed of 3,000 yards an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can move really fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a little more\Ninformation than I needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:48.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.55,0:06:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And one of the locals was even running\Naround telling everyone to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.24,0:06:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day before yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,most of the Polo family went out of town,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leaving no one there but\Nthe fourth son, Slater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.80,0:07:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, I found there's a shuttle\Nthat goes to New Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.04,0:07:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chance like this\Ndoesn't come twice. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.10,0:07:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.52,0:07:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we all agree the Polo family can't\Nbe allowed to have their way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.38,0:07:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least this time, we'll have Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rinald with us to back us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.72,0:07:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That settles it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gentlemen, this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet here again at sunup tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.16,0:07:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today I'm going to school you people!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.38,0:07:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's lesson is about typhoons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you probably don't know, here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.72,0:07:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A typhoon is a little phenomenon\Nwhere the wind blows like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crazy and carries your houses\Nand tins off into the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name is Jacqueline, and this lovely\Nyoung lady has come to wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this about, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typhoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you expecting a relative\Nof yours sometime soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.38,0:08:00.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is that what a typhoon is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.30,0:08:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A furious beauty who levels entire\Ncities without even a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:05.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:11.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way, who's picking\Nup the tab for this little food?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me? Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one gracious enough\Nto give it to your stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.36,0:08:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whining and come all the\Nway out here to New Oregon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't ask you to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This town may look peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.46,0:08:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but things are likely to get\Nbloody around here at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if you're aware of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.22,0:08:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Polo and Frieze\Nfamilies are still quarreling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over their rights to the satellite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.98,0:08:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A girl who was a distant cousin of the\NFrieze family was murdered in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a high-stakes feud.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't want this town to\Nturn into another little jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take off before it's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But doesn't that story get you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do things like that have to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.32,0:08:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like it's anything new.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.92,0:08:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kind of thing happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.68,0:08:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the most peaceful\Nfolk will take up arms if
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone happens to threaten\Nor kill a family member.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bottom line is, we should go\Nbefore we get involved in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.90,0:09:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always had my suspicions\Nthat you were no mere mortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I never imagined\Nyou were actually a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what the hell am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is that idiot? Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.08,0:09:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altogether, your meal\Ncomes to exactly $30.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put it on my tab? No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.56,0:09:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rotten needle noggin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slater, there's a hick outside\Nasking to be let in, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.49,0:09:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in any\Nbeggars or job hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just send them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.98,0:09:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friend of mine works here,\Nand I was in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought I'd drop\Nby to say hi to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I didn't say you could\Ncome in here, street worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you here to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.96,0:09:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name is Max Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.64,0:09:48.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That old codger actually has friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.20,0:09:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, entertain him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure about this, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.38,0:09:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I really have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a friend of Max's, and I'm\Nnot about to start any trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.22,0:10:05.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did the right thing to splurge\Non a room in second class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.98,0:10:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the last time we were when\Nit is, it was full advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.14,0:10:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole experience was ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we run into him in New Oregon,\Nthings are gonna get real busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.96,0:10:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy the peace while it lasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means we're going to\Nget dragged into trouble again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.66,0:10:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.08,0:10:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands with the air and mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.94,0:10:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's better not trying anything funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.46,0:10:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you all behave\Nif you value your lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make this easy on yourself and don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you won't be\Nharmed if you just cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.56,0:11:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a chance to stop this right\Nnow and the law will be more lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.72,0:11:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave up my life a\Nlong time ago. Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:11.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a damn good reason I'm doing\Nthis, and I don't care what the cost is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've almost reached our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you keep an eye on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.06,0:11:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.97,0:11:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she were alive, she'd be\Nabout your age now, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.90,0:11:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not finished with the forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat it, leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.40,0:11:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see you haven't\Nchanged a bit, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to the old snappy outfit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I kind of wore\Nit out on my last job
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.27,0:11:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,welcome back you are here on business or\Njust come to pick up Jacqueline's dress
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.94,0:11:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.85,0:11:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has it really been ten years\Nsince your last visit Vash?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Marcy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill anyone who resists!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Monster just crashed a sand steamer\Ninto my exalted place of work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard of people falling asleep\Nat the wheel, but this is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. F!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.47,0:12:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, this is bad. Looks like a raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of New Oregon, listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.44,0:12:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Freeze family has seized\Nthe satellite facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The injustice we have suffered\Nat the hands of the greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.48,0:12:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vicious Polos have left us with no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have but one demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.54,0:12:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring us the head of the Polo family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.84,0:12:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a guest we think will\Nbe of great interest to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.41,0:13:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our demands are not\Nmet within three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.96,0:13:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not be able to\Nguarantee his safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The head of the family is in Neo-Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.94,0:13:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll never make it\Nback within three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.08,0:13:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:19.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know me, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.62,0:13:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just my nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.53,0:13:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is kill Polo, use\NJacqueline for cover, and make tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.76,0:13:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's Jacqueline?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the name of the typhoon heading\Nfor this town, and it's coming soon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.06,0:13:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's talking about the real typhoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.76,0:13:38.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the world did\Nyou mix that up Millie?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.78,0:13:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so silly it\Nslipped my mind darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate being wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get out of here Millie
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.43,0:14:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw White Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They seem to have the\Nhostages under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.40,0:14:15.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says we can do whatever we want\Nwith the others, know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love party time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two should be ashamed\Nof yourselves. Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash, amazing, are you\Nstill doing things this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.06,0:14:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a polo bodyguard?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.68,0:14:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have a death wish,\Ngentlemen, try to take us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.40,0:14:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before you do, you should know\Nthat this man is Vash, the Stampede.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.66,0:14:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.42,0:14:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you at least act the part?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll chicken out and\Nrun away and we won't
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to fight them do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's up there Benson?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one to shoot here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.14,0:15:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take your finger off the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.68,0:15:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? It's the gunman. It's Vash\Nthe Stampede. He's coming our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's coming you saw him But why what\Nwould vast stampede be doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like a bad dream\Nenough calm down, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.78,0:15:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rumors like this are\Nalways exaggerated and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he is the real thing he still\Nhas to take that passage to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way in. Remember, it's\Nthe reason we chose this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.64,0:16:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Total slaughter, total slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't leave a single man alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:19.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La-dee-da-dee-dae.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.46,0:16:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La-dee-da-dee-dae.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.76,0:16:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ocean of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.16,0:16:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's begin the killing time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, what horrible lyrics!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.48,0:16:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.28,0:16:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:47.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I ask you something? Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to call off our\Nlittle game like a sensible adult?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather get injured\Nand be out of the game for good?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about a new game?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.02,0:16:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll answer your question\Nwith another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I'll play, do you\Nwant a belly full of lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A negotiations breakdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:25.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, this guy can't be for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.56,0:17:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Renowned!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.76,0:17:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.18,0:17:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fight is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to let\Ngo of the hostage now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.02,0:17:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm grateful to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's out of the\Nway, I'm gonna get to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll whack you, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could possibly give you the\Nright to do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.46,0:18:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give the guy a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you knock it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.84,0:18:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.24,0:18:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bastard killed her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.00,0:18:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed my daughter, and he's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna pay for her\Ndeath with his life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're nothing like God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only do we have limited powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we sometimes are driven to\Nbecome the devil himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.68,0:18:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your answer this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.12,0:18:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.44,0:18:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.72,0:18:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear God, Donahue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.54,0:18:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know she's related to the freeze,\Nbut she had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I've finished here, you\Ncan hand me over to the sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.44,0:19:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.60,0:19:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.22,0:19:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you beg for your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.56,0:19:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about my daughter begging for hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw what you did\Nto my little Eileen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.50,0:19:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Eileen, no human being\Ncould do such an evil thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You people, you people aren't\Nhuman, and you all need to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me die! Stop! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.84,0:19:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, stop, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Justice at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donut, it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.32,0:19:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must avenge her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.70,0:19:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.22,0:19:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can never understand how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.30,0:19:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.90,0:20:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.30,0:20:14.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times did my\Ndaughter scream for her daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.18,0:20:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't take this man's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't kill him, please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:28.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.01,0:20:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is so strange, Eileen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.00,0:20:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to avenge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I do it? He should die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.76,0:21:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank goodness. Huh? It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad it's over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it would be a good\Nidea to get both of them as
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.82,0:21:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far away from here as we can\Nbefore the cavalry arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stretch over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shootout which began late\Nthis afternoon was brought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to a safe conclusion with one\Nswift charge of the cavalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The twelve idiots who were held\Nhostage, myself included, were freed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.04,0:21:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For an incident involving the humanoid\Ntyphoon, the damage wasn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day after tomorrow, a real\Ntyphoon is coming to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be very, very careful, boys and girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.92,0:21:42.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go easy on the nice guy stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta start taking care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.18,0:21:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luck and persistence won't work forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.64,0:21:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Long time no see. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.04,0:22:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have now found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will total everything, so my\Nconclusion will then be final.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.34,0:22:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vash the Stampede has\Nbegun to move, Mr. Legato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.64,0:22:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.50,0:22:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is in the future. As we can't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.72,0:23:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In times of hardship,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.06,0:24:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in times of sadness, there is a place\Nthe Traveler can let his mind return to,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,home.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.64,0:24:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what kind of a past the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.00,0:24:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Traveler abandoned when\Nhe left his home behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't know what\Nkind of sorrow he bears,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the Traveler can keep walking forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he has something which sustains\Nhim, a place which accepts him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.14,0:24:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can walk forward, step by careful step.

